    </annotations>
  </section>
  <section>
    <prefix>Regulation</prefix>
    <num>.02</num>
    <heading>Requirements.</heading>
    <para>
      <num>A.</num>
      <text>Except as otherwise provided, a load shall be enclosed in conformance with <cite doc="Md. Code" path="gtr|24-106">Transportation Article, §24-106</cite>.1, Annotated Code of Maryland.</text>
    </para>
    <para>
      <num>B.</num>
      <text>Dump service registered vehicles operating in combination with another vehicle may not be allowed the weight exemptions provided for this class of registration.</text>
    </para>
